          "_key": "sc26",
          "text": "Ski area operators are mostly immune to liability for skier-on-skier collisions. Therefore, it is sometimes difficult to find a source of funds for compensation. If the at-fault skier has homeowner’s insurance or an umbrella policy, that policy may provide coverage.",
